<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak aluminium firm ZSNP H1 pretax falls.</title>
<headline>Slovak aluminium firm ZSNP H1 pretax falls.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(in million crowns):</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   212.5   vs	   231</p>
<p> Production	     5,300     vs	 4,734</p>
<p> Sales		    5,600     vs	 4,609</p>
<p> Exports		  4,200     vs	 3,750</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is ZNSP a.s. Results are unconsolidated, but include companies in which the aluminium maker holds 50 percent or more. ZSNP is state-controlled through a 74-percent stake held by the state privatisation agency, the NPF.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
